{"type":"message","id":"af6ec42a","parentId":"ab178e48","timestamp":"2026-05-18T10:19:02.915Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_EXLZfUwSl8REz5GPNutKrlKb","toolName":"process","content":[{"type":"text","text":"    <description>Strategy&#39;s Michael Saylor called Strive&#39;s impending shift to daily dividend payments &#34;impressive.&#34;</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>André Beganski</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367878</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/decrypt-style-strive-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/decrypt-style-strive-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Kimi WebBridge Lets AI Agents Drive Your Browser—And Keep Your Data Local</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367916/kimi-webbridge-ai-agents-browser-local</link>\n  <pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 19:49:37 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Moonshot AI just shipped a browser extension that hands the wheel to AI agents. It clicks, scrolls, fills forms, and navigates your Chrome or Edge—without sessions ever leaving your machine.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jose Antonio Lanz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367916</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/ai-agents-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/ai-agents-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"1080\" width=\"1920\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>ChatGPT Is Losing Ground to Rivals—Here Are Some Numbers</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367884/chatgpt-losing-ground-anthrophic-goog\n\nProcess exited with code 23."}],"details":{"status":"completed","sessionId":"faint-otter","exitCode":23,"aggregated":"### https://www.coindesk.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/\n<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<rss xmlns:content=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\" xmlns:wfw=\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\" xmlns:dc=\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\" xmlns:atom=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom\" xmlns:sy=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/syndication/\" xmlns:slash=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\" xmlns:media=\"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/\" version=\"2.0\">\n  <channel>\n    <title>CoinDesk: Bitcoin, Ethereum, Crypto News and Price Data</title>\n    <link>https://www.coindesk.com/</link>\n    <atom:link rel=\"self\" type=\"application/rss+xml\" href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss\"/>\n    <atom:link rel=\"hub\" href=\"true\"/>\n    <description>Leader in cryptocurrency, Bitcoin, Ethereum, XRP, blockchain, DeFi, digital finance and Web 3.0 news with analysis, video and live price updates.</description>\n    <lastBuildDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 10:15:12 +0000</lastBuildDate>\n    <language>en-US</language>\n    <copyright>© 2026 CoinDesk, Inc.</copyright>\n    <generator>CoinDesk</generator>\n    <ttl>5</ttl>\n    <sy:updatePeriod>hourly</sy:updatePeriod>\n    <sy:updateFrequency>1</sy:updateFrequency>\n    <image>\n      <url>https://downloads.coindesk.com/arc/failsafe/feeds/coindesk-feed-logo.png</url>\n      <title>CoinDesk: Bitcoin, Ethereum, Crypto News and Price Data</title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/</link>\n    </image>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Crypto security 