networks as contagion fears ease.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Sam Reynolds</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets\"><![CDATA[Markets]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Ethereum News]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[DeFi]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Bitcoin Depot, North America's largest bitcoin ATM operator, files for bankruptcy]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/18/bitcoin-depot-once-north-america-s-largest-bitcoin-atm-operator-files-for-bankruptcy</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/a45ef8c230cbc6cd1c4c06fdd0e6b9ca2e141d6a-5184x3456.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">5dfe81b7-27d7-4af2-8ddf-1b0b45aeb5ce</guid>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 06:55:50 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[Bitcoin Depot, the largest bitcoin ATM operator in North America and publicly listed on Nasdaq, has filed for Chapter 11 bankruptcy.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Omkar Godbole</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets\"><![CDATA[Markets]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Bitcoin News]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Iran may be turning the Strait of Hormuz into a bitcoin-based insurance market, local reports say]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/18/iran-may-be-turning-the-strait-of-hormuz-into-a-bitcoin-insurance-market-local-reports-say</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/ea6e0ec4cd84026d0707ce39424079748bd5f9fb-3449x2300.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">7331d70f-ceae-436e-8229-2309e55c6615</guid>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 06:47:37 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[State-linked Fars News reported that Iran’s economy ministry has been working on a plan to manage shipping through the Strait with payments in bitcoin.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Shaurya Malwa</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets\"><![CDATA[Markets]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Crypto traders betting on a rally lose $563 million in liquidations. Ether and bitcoin suffer the most]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/18/crypto-traders-betting-on-a-rally-lose-usd563-million-in-liquidations-ether-and-bitcoin-suffer-the-most</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/89e4b518d02edc14f05e23e5067e30e82e673fb5-600x439.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">3c471d83-c979-4571-b7b2-3ef989a4a7ae</guid>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 05:47:13 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[Ether and bitcoin led liquidations, as their prices dropped on macroeconomic concerns. ]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Omkar Godbole</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets\"><![CDATA[Markets]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Bitcoin News]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Ethereum News]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[HYPE pops 7%, beating bitcoin declines, as SpaceX pre-IPO lands on Hyperliquid]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/18/hype-pops-7-beating-bitcoin-declines-as-spacex-pre-ipo-lands-on-hyperliquid</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/97bf2e29eb3c1b7bbc38861e392cdd3baacfcacf-1919x1080.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">ef726021-aea3-4de6-892b-1f2527a63eef</guid>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 05:01:11 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[Hyperliquid's HYPE token rallied 7% over 24 hours after Trade.xyz launched the first pre-IPO perpetual market on the platform, offering synthetic exposure to SpaceX at a reference valuation of $1.78 trillion.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Shaurya Malwa</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets\"><![CDATA[Markets]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Yet another crypto bridge falls victim to an $11 million hack]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/18/yet-another-crypto-bridge-falls-victim-to-an-usd11-million-hack</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/6c28c3dcd5461d3803d6e6200f1da0686dde993f-1920x1082.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">1a76291b-f3e5-46f5-bc3d-0f30929c635c</guid>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 04:37:06 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[The latest attack adds to growing string of cross-chain infrastructure exploits.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Omkar Godbole</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets\"><![CDATA[Markets]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Ethereum News]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Hack]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[DeFi]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Bitcoin slides under $77,000 as oil shock and Treasury yields hit risk assets]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/18/bitcoin-slides-under-usd77-000-as-oil-shock-and-treasury-yields-hit-risk-assets</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/1c54047de088aba1b682dc2e1df4bb1d1be37672-3840x2160.png?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">a7817ead-599d-461e-9760-df860fb466ef</guid>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 03:52:10 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[Long-term holders are still sitting tight and exchange balances remain near six-year lows, Binance Research data shows, but underwater short-term holders leave BTC vulnerable to macro shocks.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Sam Reynolds</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets\"><![CDATA[Markets]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Bitcoin News]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[The Clarity Act took a step forward: State of Crypto ]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/05/17/the-clarity-act-took-a-step-forward-state-of-crypto</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/39aef47b93f60ebf7e668e371d51320693bb79e3-3364x1894.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">968cda10-3baf-41d0-b84e-0506ef7bebb1</guid>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 17 May 2026 18:30:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[Unpacking Thursday's at-times contentious markup hearing.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Nikhilesh De</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/policy\"><![CDATA[Policy]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Newsletters]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[State of Crypto]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Clarity Act]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[DeFi's new front: VerifiedX bets bitcoin's next chapter is programmable, private]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/tech/2026/05/17/defi-s-new-front-verifiedx-bets-bitcoin-s-next-chapter-is-programmable-private</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/47b7f712ab1de4180258cf8cac4023a4dae4cb87-1920x1080.png?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">d13f6ca5-097a-4654-853d-ad6feb141123</guid>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 17 May 2026 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[VerifiedX says its Bitcoin sidechain enables programmable, privacy-preserving transactions without synthetic wrappers, targeting growing institutional demand for native DeFi on the original blockchain system.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Jamie Crawley</dc:creator>\n      <dc:creator>AI Boost</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/tech\"><![CDATA[Tech]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Privacy]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Bitcoin News]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[DeFi]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Japan's SBI Securities, Rakuten Securities plan to offer crypto investment trusts]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/05/17/japan-s-sbi-securities-rakuten-securities-plan-to-offer-crypto-investment-trusts</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/513f15ff40f6e6e9caf1a75ebe728c61199e91e1-997x577.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">db6832c1-0b31-4a48-bede-a4d7d1b3c27f</guid>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 17 May 2026 11:41:31 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[Another 11 companies responded to a survey saying they would consider offering crypto funds once the regulatory environment becomes clear.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Sheldon Reback</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business\"><![CDATA[Finance]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Japan]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[ETFs]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[A Russian stablecoin built to dodge sanctions says it can survive even if they're lifted]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/05/24/a-russian-stablecoin-built-to-dodge-sanctions-says-it-can-survive-even-if-they-re-lifted</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/0522bac88865161da0044016661f4490ea9d1002-1920x1080.png?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">23348742-aeae-43f8-afdb-13d2e7d707af</guid>\n      <pubDate>Sun, 17 May 2026 08:00:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[ A7A5, the Russia-linked stablecoin built to move money around banking restrictions, says faster trade settlement, yield and regional crypto infrastructure could keep it relevant even if geopolitical tensions ease. ]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Sam Reynolds</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/policy\"><![CDATA[Policy]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Stablecoins]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Jump Crypto’s ‘Firedancer’ is taking a slow and steady approach to its long-awaited Solana infrastructure rollout ]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/tech/2026/05/16/jump-crypto-s-firedancer-is-taking-a-slow-and-steady-approach-to-its-long-awaited-solana-infrastructure-rollout</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/4b7520ee19a2cdef1913aad770116849790cafe0-1520x932.png?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">5d62c751-4db0-4170-b7bc-448c5c918c8a</guid>\n      <pubDate>Sat, 16 May 2026 15:00:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[In an interview with CoinDesk, the lead engineer at Firedancer gives an update on how the new client, also known as a software, is fairing in the Solana ecosystem. \n]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Margaux Nijkerk</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/tech\"><![CDATA[Tech]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Solana News]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Crypto users are choosing juicy yields over protection, putting billions at risk of hacks]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/05/16/crypto-users-are-choosing-juicy-yields-over-protection-putting-billions-at-risk-of-hacks</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/4c5a253acfede39012d282e82fa00a50cf8cf434-1440x1080.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">feb0b076-32c4-4644-8e47-85b7553617ee</guid>\n      <pubDate>Sat, 16 May 2026 14:00:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[DeFi insurance protocols debuted with huge ambitions during the 2020 crypto boom. But as hacks evolved and users chased yields over protection, most of the sector collapsed under the same risks it was built to cover.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Omkar Godbole</dc:creator>\n      <dc:creator>Olivier Acuna</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business\"><![CDATA[Finance]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[DeFi]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[The $293 million KelpDAO hack shows why DeFi is finally being forced to grow up]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/tech/2026/05/16/the-usd293-million-kelpdao-hack-shows-why-defi-is-finally-being-forced-to-grow-up</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/6c28c3dcd5461d3803d6e6200f1da0686dde993f-1920x1082.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">e4b4d75d-3df2-4956-83d7-c52c023a53d4</guid>\n      <pubDate>Sat, 16 May 2026 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[For protocol founders and security researchers, the incident reinforced a broader shift underway across crypto: DeFi is no longer primarily battling coding bugs. It’s battling complexity.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Margaux Nijkerk</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/tech\"><![CDATA[Tech]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Ethereum News]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Hack]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[XRP beat bitcoin gains as Clarity Act advanced, but a real bullrun still needs Congress]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/15/xrp-beat-bitcoin-gains-as-clarity-act-advanced-but-a-real-bullrun-still-needs-congress</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/b870a99b3666942b2ac0a5c20219248585e42b45-6016x4016.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">d526339a-7ff3-4fe0-8c4c-6385a06d164a</guid>\n      <pubDate>Sat, 16 May 2026 11:30:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[The token jumped 5% after a Senate committee moved the market-structure bill forward, reviving hopes that legal clarity can pull deeper institutional money into XRP products.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Shaurya Malwa</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets\"><![CDATA[Markets]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Crypto longs lose $500 million as bitcoin slides to $78,000, SOL and XRP down 5%]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/16/crypto-longs-lose-usd500-million-as-bitcoin-slides-to-usd78-000-sol-and-xrp-down-5</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/de7a9518cddb59a1c88001dff7cf60e2ae2acebe-1918x1080.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">bd08555f-7324-4c5c-9936-21ee89b93661</guid>\n      <pubDate>Sat, 16 May 2026 07:36:02 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[A long-skewed liquidation cascade flushed leverage across the major tokens overnight, with the move tracking a global bond selloff and the worst session for U.S. stocks since March.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Shaurya Malwa</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets\"><![CDATA[Markets]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Bhutan ‘doesn’t recall’ selling any bitcoin, disputing widely tracked $1 billion BTC drawdown]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/16/bhutan-doesn-t-recall-selling-any-bitcoin-disputing-widely-tracked-usd1-billion-btc-drawdown</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/adf4cf82040d1106a3db7981dca4bd3bfd1b5efc-1440x825.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">0e974efe-81b7-4bb3-8bdd-10311e5bbc6a</guid>\n      <pubDate>Sat, 16 May 2026 02:30:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[Arkham Intelligence data shows that over $1 billion in bitcoin has left wallets attributed to Bhutan in the past year, flowing to exchanges and trading firms. The country says it has not sold any.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Shaurya Malwa</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets\"><![CDATA[Markets]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[U.S. House lawmakers who oversee the CFTC are urging Trump to fill the commission ]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/05/15/u-s-house-lawmakers-who-oversee-the-cftc-are-urging-trump-to-fill-the-commission</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/3f569f15b09723815a51e15de0540d00fb56d010-2647x1491.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">c0744c5b-5e9b-46a2-bf83-d33d9395ca5a</guid>\n      <pubDate>Fri, 15 May 2026 21:35:57 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[As the Commodity Futures Trading Commission takes on a growing task to police U.S. crypto trading, senior lawmakers are saying it needs bipartisan leadership.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Jesse Hamilton</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/policy\"><![CDATA[Policy]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Regulation]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Donald Trump]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[SpaceX targets June 11 IPO pricing, picks Nasdaq for historic market debut]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/15/spacex-targets-june-11-ipo-pricing-picks-nasdaq-for-historic-market-debut</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/012d1341028a1540b46a72e80e723e4b03811a47-594x396.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">aefaed90-0954-409f-b97a-915b5265f909</guid>\n      <pubDate>Fri, 15 May 2026 19:50:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[Elon Musk’s rocket and satellite company has accelerated plans for its blockbuster public offering, with trading expected to begin as early as June 12 after a faster-than-expected SEC review.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Helene Braun</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets\"><![CDATA[Markets]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[SpaceX]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Saudi Arabia is tokenizing its multi-trillion dollar economy to protect its wealth from global shocks]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/05/15/saudi-arabia-is-tokenizing-its-multi-trillion-dollar-economy-to-protect-its-wealth-from-global-shocks</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/00893b2ecd5808fcefafd24575ecbf72bb72a3ea-1897x1290.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">a63bcdc7-6797-412e-9d12-db667a4b43a8</guid>\n      <pubDate>Fri, 15 May 2026 16:37:31 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[The chairman of droppRWA has secured $12.5 billion in mandates to tokenized real estate and his plans are to go beyond properties to bring trillions of dollars onchain.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Olivier Acuna</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business\"><![CDATA[Finance]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Tokenization]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Stablecoins]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Lombard joins LayerZero exodus as $4 billion in assets switch to Chainlink's bridge]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/05/15/lombard-joins-layerzero-exodus-as-usd4-billion-in-assets-switch-to-chainlink-s-bridge</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/a65930d01e519d4b324288666fb010a01d332c9a-4030x2267.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">577533da-7651-4816-97ee-2b84d009e701</guid>\n      <pubDate>Fri, 15 May 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[The shift comes after the Kelp DAO exploit drained $292 million from its LayerZero-powered bridge, increasing concerns over the security of cross-chain infrastructure.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Francisco Rodrigues</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business\"><![CDATA[Finance]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[DeFi]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Exclusive]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[CME, ICE push U.S. regulators to scrutinize Hyperliquid over manipulation risks]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/15/cme-ice-push-u-s-regulators-to-scrutinize-hyperliquid-over-manipulation-risks-bloomberg</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/4d8a5dd9fde8fa666cb774a9667e304080fea9c9-5041x3370.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">97eb6d64-ad02-41d1-8edd-e946256c8c53</guid>\n      <pubDate>Fri, 15 May 2026 15:46:46 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[CME Group and ICE have reportedly warned the CFTC and Capitol Hill officials that Hyperliquid’s decentralized perpetual futures platform could enable market manipulation and sanctions evasion.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Helene Braun</dc:creator>\n      <dc:creator>AI Boost</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets\"><![CDATA[Markets]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[NYSE]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Iran war shows markets no longer sleep]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/opinion/2026/05/15/iran-war-shows-markets-no-longer-sleep</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/c74bcf678462c3428e03176379298db8581f8964-3500x2000.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">dd181250-7fff-4c85-a476-6779741c5ccf</guid>\n      <pubDate>Fri, 15 May 2026 15:30:00 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[The latest conflict involving Iran has produced an unexpected proving ground for financial infrastructure, and an unlikely winner has emerged, argues Huang.\n]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Annabelle Huang</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/opinion\"><![CDATA[Opinion]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Iran]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">Opinion</category>\n    </it\n\n### https://cointelegraph.com/rss\n<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"utf-8\"?>\n<rss version=\"2.0\" xmlns:content=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\" xmlns:media=\"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/\" xmlns:dc=\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\" xmlns:wfw=\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\" xmlns:atom=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom\" xmlns:sy=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/syndication/\" xmlns:slash=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\">\n  <channel>\n    <title>Cointelegraph.com News</title>\n    <link>https://cointelegraph.com</link>\n    <atom:link href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/rss?_q=1779099079254&amp;r=fw0v8t&amp;ttt=1779099079254&amp;vfff=1779099079\" rel=\"self\" type=\"application/rss+xml\"/>\n    <description>Cointelegraph covers fintech, blockchain and Bitcoin bringing you the latest crypto news and analyses on the future of money.</description>\n    <generator>cointelegraph.com</generator>\n    <lastBuildDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 10:11:20 +0000</lastBuildDate>\n    <language>en</language>\n    <sy:updatePeriod>hourly</sy:updatePeriod>\n    <sy:updateFrequency>1</sy:updateFrequency>\n    <image>\n      <title>Cointelegraph.com News</title>\n      <link>https://cointelegraph.com</link>\n      <url>https://s3.cointelegraph.com/storage/uploads/view/b9ea15d46738b4df64e6e100ab59b373.png</url>\n      <description>Cointelegraph covers fintech, blockchain and Bitcoin bringing you the latest crypto news and analyses on the future of money.</description>\n    </image>\n    <item>\n      <title>Kraken cuts 150 staff amid AI efficiencies, potentially delaying IPO: Report</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 07:14:27 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 18 May 2026 07:14:27 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/kraken-parent-payward-cuts-150-staff-potentially-delaying-ipo-report</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/kraken-parent-payward-cuts-150-staff-potentially-delaying-ipo-report?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1rcmFrZW4taXBvLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Kraken cuts 150 staff amid AI efficiencies, potentially delaying IPO: Report\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Kraken has cut 150 staff due to the rising use of AI, adding to more than 5,000 layoffs across the crypto sector so far this year, Bloomberg reports.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Jesse Coghlan</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1rcmFrZW4taXBvLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1rcmFrZW4taXBvLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Verus Ethereum bridge reportedly exploited for $11.6M in latest DeFi attack</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 07:11:30 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 18 May 2026 07:11:30 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/verus-ethereum-bridge-reportedly-exploited-for-millions</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/verus-ethereum-bridge-reportedly-exploited-for-millions?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9ibG9ja2NoYWluLXRlY2hub2xvZ3ktYnJpZGdlLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Verus Ethereum bridge reportedly exploited for $11.6M in latest DeFi attack\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Two security companies have flagged the address where the stolen funds are allegedly being held, showing the cryptocurrencies have been converted into 5,402 Ether.\n</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Stephen Katte</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9ibG9ja2NoYWluLXRlY2hub2xvZ3ktYnJpZGdlLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9ibG9ja2NoYWluLXRlY2hub2xvZ3ktYnJpZGdlLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Surging oil prices have been driving Ether selling pressure: Tom Lee</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 07:02:06 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 18 May 2026 07:02:06 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/surging-oil-prices-key-driver-of-eth-selling-pressure-says-tom-lee</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/surging-oil-prices-key-driver-of-eth-selling-pressure-says-tom-lee?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9vaWwtYml0Y29pbi1jb2luLWFudC1ibG9ja2NoYWluLXNreS1wbGF0Zm9ybS1wcm9kdWN0aW9uLTIuanBn.jpg\" alt=\"Surging oil prices have been driving Ether selling pressure: Tom Lee\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Fundstrat's Tom Lee pointed out an inverse correlation between crude and Ether as oil surged back to around $110 on Monday. \n</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Martin Young</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9vaWwtYml0Y29pbi1jb2luLWFudC1ibG9ja2NoYWluLXNreS1wbGF0Zm9ybS1wcm9kdWN0aW9uLTIuanBn.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9vaWwtYml0Y29pbi1jb2luLWFudC1ibG9ja2NoYWluLXNreS1wbGF0Zm9ybS1wcm9kdWN0aW9uLTIuanBn.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Reports suggest Iran is mulling Hormuz ‘insurance’ scheme, paid in Bitcoin</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 06:53:38 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 18 May 2026 06:53:38 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/iran-mulls-platform-for-ships-transiting-strait-of-hormuz-to-pay-in-bitcoin-report</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/iran-mulls-platform-for-ships-transiting-strait-of-hormuz-to-pay-in-bitcoin-report?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9ob3JtdXotc3RyYWl0LmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Reports suggest Iran is mulling Hormuz ‘insurance’ scheme, paid in Bitcoin\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Screenshots of a website called “Hormuz Safe” have been circulating on social media, which offers “digital insurance” for ships passing through the Strait of Hormuz.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Brayden Lindrea</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9ob3JtdXotc3RyYWl0LmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9ob3JtdXotc3RyYWl0LmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Senate crypto bill at risk beyond midterms if not passed by August: NYDIG</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 05:23:11 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 18 May 2026 05:23:11 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/senate-crypto-bill-august-advance-in-lame-duck-session-nydig</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/senate-crypto-bill-august-advance-in-lame-duck-session-nydig?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1hLXN0ZXAtdG93YXJkcy1iZXR0ZXItZ292ZXJubWVudC11c2luZy1jcnlwdG8tMS5qcGc=.jpg\" alt=\"Senate crypto bill at risk beyond midterms if not passed by August: NYDIG\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>NYDIG’s Greg Cipolaro says the Senate’s crypto market structure bill is at risk of failing if it cannot clear a floor vote by August.\n</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Jesse Coghlan</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1hLXN0ZXAtdG93YXJkcy1iZXR0ZXItZ292ZXJubWVudC11c2luZy1jcnlwdG8tMS5qcGc=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1hLXN0ZXAtdG93YXJkcy1iZXR0ZXItZ292ZXJubWVudC11c2luZy1jcnlwdG8tMS5qcGc=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Analysts debate whether Bitcoin is in ‘sell in May’ bear market setup</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 05:06:21 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 18 May 2026 05:06:21 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/sell-in-may-historical-pattern-could-see-btc-back-at-33k-analyst</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/sell-in-may-historical-pattern-could-see-btc-back-at-33k-analyst?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9lb3NldGhlcmV1bW1hcmtldGZhbGxiaWd3YXZlLW5ldy5qcGc=.jpg\" alt=\"Analysts debate whether Bitcoin is in ‘sell in May’ bear market setup\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Some analysts argue that a comparatively broadened, institutionalized buyer base for crypto today may prevent a repeat of the drawdowns seen in May 2018 and May 2022. </p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Martin Young</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9lb3NldGhlcmV1bW1hcmtldGZhbGxiaWd3YXZlLW5ldy5qcGc=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9lb3NldGhlcmV1bW1hcmtldGZhbGxiaWd3YXZlLW5ldy5qcGc=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>WETH markets return to normal operations on Aave amid rsETH recovery progress</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 05:02:08 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 18 May 2026 05:02:08 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/aave-restores-weth-borrowing-after-kelp-dao-rseth-exploit</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/aave-restores-weth-borrowing-after-kelp-dao-rseth-exploit?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9wYXNzd29yZC1mcmF1ZC1oYWNrZXItc2NhbTQuanBn.jpg\" alt=\"WETH markets return to normal operations on Aave amid rsETH recovery progress\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Aave applied a temporary freeze to WETH as a precautionary safety measure in response to the Kelp DAO exploit, alongside freezes on the rsETH and wrsETH reserves. </p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Stephen Katte</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9wYXNzd29yZC1mcmF1ZC1oYWNrZXItc2NhbTQuanBn.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9wYXNzd29yZC1mcmF1ZC1oYWNrZXItc2NhbTQuanBn.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Grayscale, VanEck amend US spot BNB ETF filings, stepping closer to potential launch</title>\n      <pubDate>Mon, 18 May 2026 02:40:22 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Mon, 18 May 2026 02:40:22 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/grayscale-vaneck-advance-bnb-etf-filings-for-potential-sec-approval</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/grayscale-vaneck-advance-bnb-etf-filings-for-potential-sec-approval?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1rLWxhdW5jaC1mdW5kaW5nLWZvci1jb3VydC1jYXNlLXZzLXNlYy0yLWV0Zi5qcGc=.jpg\" alt=\"Grayscale, VanEck amend US spot BNB ETF filings, stepping closer to potential launch\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>The US securities regulator approved 21Shares’ Hyperliquid ETF last week, adding to a growing number of cryptocurrencies converted into ETF wrappers in the US.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Brayden Lindrea</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRp