  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Gemini Stock Jumps on Revenue Rise, $100M Bitcoin Investment From Winklevoss Capital</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367978/gemini-stock-jumps-revenue-rise-100m-bitcoin-investment-winklevoss</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 15 May 2026 14:11:42 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Crypto exchange Gemini secured a $100 million Bitcoin investment from its founders’ fund, and revealed a 42% YOY Q1 revenue bump.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367978</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/cameron-tyler-winklevoss-twins-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/cameron-tyler-winklevoss-twins-decrypt-style-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"1080\" width=\"1920\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Bitcoin Shrugs Off CLARITY Gains as Institutions Sell Amid Surging Treasury Yields</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/367952/bitcoin-shrugs-off-clarity-gains-as-institutions-sell-amid-surging-treasury-yields</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 15 May 2026 13:00:30 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Analysts point to profit-taking, not panic, with ETF outflows at their worst pace since February as 10-year Treasury yield soars.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Akash Girimath</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=367952</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Bitcoin_chart-1-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n